    "body": "## Current execution and accepted outcomes\n\nThe current integration source remains [51416b2f156b341c4a5f09029e2c6ceb5b30b1e7](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/51416b2f156b341c4a5f09029e2c6ceb5b30b1e7). [Canonical CI 44655969487, attempt 1](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/actions/runs/44655969487) completed successfully. The source ref is being held steady for the original live G2 observation.\n\n- **DG17 P04: complete original case accepted at exact a297.** The actual hosted stale-continuity refusal, genuine timely Root re-anchor, canonical G0002 transition and identical pending operation completed successfully. Independent original receiving and Root adjudication are published in [Results17](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/tree/47be114377a28e5974c1d41f823d0a53aff0afe4/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261120-17). This adds P04 only; it does not award another mutation family, terminal clause or model-configuration scope.\n- **DG18 criterion 10 is accepted at current51416** in [Results16](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/tree/8807b8e966c9d23749e94e8f8ff41903ef8a93a9/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261120-16). **Existing criterion 11 is now accepted at current51416** after all four actual installed-runtime routes, full terminal artifact and independent original receiving in [Results18](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/tree/e852e16ae9ce29492312e66e46f081d0b45e3d7d/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261120-18). The original denominator remains14; authentic OR/C02 and historical N1 are separate.\n- **Original DG16 G2 is running:** [run44666584405, attempt1](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/actions/runs/44666584405) passed its fresh nine-case native bank and receiving, and is executing the complete legacy/DAG pair. It has not yet earned original M2. The exact live independent review, genuine Root consumption and hosted closing custody remain required. Do not restart the existing pair.\n- **G132:** all eleven original input roles have been recovered exactly. The fresh source-only host candidate [b393a9057c249335e6cdf4ccbb898d192b0830b8](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/b393a9057c249335e6cdf4ccbb898d192b0830b8) and its complete prospective model have been generated and source-load checked. No new protected ref, host launch, private sender or original G1/G3 award has occurred. Historical301 remains UNKNOWN_NO_REPLAY.\n\nThe current results branch is [e852e16ae9ce29492312e66e46f081d0b45e3d7d](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/e852e16ae9ce29492312e66e46f081d0b45e3d7d), with the six new C11 evidence leaves and all3682 preceding leaves read back unchanged. P03's real behavioral result remains subject to its exact effective-model/configuration gap; N06 later-stage actor requirements remain open. All prior accepted, failed, survived, lost and unknown scopes remain preserved.\n\n**Whole-cell acceptance remains0/3.** Original DG16 M1–M6/48 requirements, DG17 36cases/14mutation families/17terminal clauses and DG18 14criteria with binding amendments are unchanged. PR255 stays open, draft and unmerged; no release or issue closure is requested.\n\n---\n\n## Earlier navigation retained at its historical cutoff\n\n## Latest published continuation\n\nThe integration source correction is published at [51416b2f156b341c4a5f09029e2c6ceb5b30b1e7](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/51416b2f156b341c4a5f09029e2c6ceb5b30b1e7). It admits the exact restored continuity-source compositions, updates their compiler/receiver bindings, and preserves historical profiles and source specimens. The clean source build satisfies the unchanged package limits. [CI run 44655969487, attempt 1](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/actions/runs/44655969487) was last observed in progress before this update; no terminal CI or original G2 result is inferred.\n\nResults continuation 15 is published at [50596acb17596b3e86c87f20ba440b7e3d27e0ac](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/50596acb17596b3e86c87f20ba440b7e3d27e0ac): [immutable evidence index](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/tree/50596acb17596b3e86c87f20ba440b7e3d27e0ac/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261119-15). All 33 additions were read back, and all 3,636 predecessor files were preserved.\n\nThat publication preserves the authentic P03 behavioral episode and its remaining model-configuration qualification gap; the independently received hosted G2 reviewer-to-consumer transport demonstration; the actual N06 first-L1 verifier failure and source receiving; and recovered G132 inputs/interface and DG18 source work. These scopes do not award original M2, original G1/G3, a complete new DG17 case, or whole DG18.\n\nAll three original cells remain incomplete. This PR remains open and draft, with no merge, release or issue closure requested. Historical protected UNKNOWN effects and original denominators are unchanged. The earlier checkpoint navigation and its complete text follow unchanged.\n\n---\n\n## Continuing DG16–DG18 execution\n\nThis PR remains open and draft. No merge, release, issue closure or whole-cell acceptance is requested.\n\nCheckpoint 11 is published at [951dcbcfb1501e12c75c4813b343e3896190cf12](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/commit/951dcbcfb1501e12c75c4813b343e3896190cf12) on `engineering/pro-executor-original-completion-20261115`, with all 30 added files and 3,577 unchanged prior files remotely verified. [Checkpoint index](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/tree/engineering/pro-executor-original-completion-20261115/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261119-11) · [Complete earlier PR body](https://github.com/theislampill/IMPLEMENTAUDIT.md/blob/engineering/pro-executor-original-completion-20261115/handoff/pro-executor-results-20261115/continuing-execution-20261119-11/PR255_PRIOR_BODY.md).\n\n### Evidence preserved at the checkpoint cutoff\n\n| Scope | Recorded result and boundary |\n|---|---|\n| DG16 G2 run 44239735578 | Five correspondence relations equal and timely control present; terminal run failed without required hosted consumption/closing evidence. Original M2 remains unawarded. No late control or pair relaunch. |\n| DG16 G132 portability | Actual unreferenced candidate `bd347ba6848e976c993ec82f5aa85d8e5964f6e1`, sole parent `301aeecde08ba6f169bc3cd837eae6f6ad068219`, tree `bc3f8f1a10cbea041a6bf066acda113f3252360b`, and explicitly rebound source are received. Protected `625f…/301…` remains UNKNOWN_NO_REPLAY. Original root-owned G1/G3 execution is unawarded. |\n| DG17 ordinary helper | Revised source received independent bounded PASS and actual governor consumption. Candidate `dc64d434d7bcafdd6d4487d275adbed4dd08b4a1` has sole parent `a297957be11feb494c0ec467235794a1e0c54751` and four exact additions. Candidate-bound readiness and hosted results are outside this checkpoint cutoff. |\n| DG17 N09, N10, H03 | Prior N09 bounded original observation is preserved. N10 semantic/return limbs remain received, but whole N10 is NONVERDICT with the historical route-marker omission. H03 literal semantic admission is accepted with partial capture; whole-case historical qualification remains NONVERDICT. |\n| Other DG17 scopes | Previously accepted structural, consumer, model-policy and mutation scopes retain their exact identities and limits. They do not award all 36 cases, 14 mutation families or 17 terminal clauses. Authentic native Stop/session obligations remain separate. |\n| DG18 | Accepted W-FULL, criterion 11 and occurrence/cold-receiving scopes are preserved. Authentic OR/C02 prerequisites remain open. Historical N1 remains LOST/UNKNOWN with no exception. |\n\n### Continuing work and authority\n\nRoot remains the sole integration writer. Ordinary bounded engineering, testing, evidence receiving and nonprotected publication continue under the standing owner commission. Protected single-use effects and acceptance changes remain separately controlled.\n\nCheckpoint 11 archives the full earlier PR body byte-exact: 63,432 bytes, SHA-256 `9e9e49463b763a1fe33268f374aec9dc6c689b5ecd3e3cf18e974faaf9f26827`. Earlier narrative and evidence are retained there; this shorter index supplies the current navigation. Later review, preparation or execution results will be published as separate evidence rather than backfilled into this frozen checkpoint.\n\nOriginal DG16 M1–M6/48 requirements, DG17 17 terminal clauses/36 cases/14 mutation families/applicable host conditions, and DG18 14 criteria plus binding amendments remain unchanged.\n\n",
